  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "mind-project-0",
      "title": "Mục tiêu dự án",
      "summary": "Bắt đầu từ chủ đề trung tâm rồi khám phá ba nhánh.",
      "type": "topic",
      "tags": [
        "mind-project"
      ],
      "content": "Mục tiêu dự án\nÝ chính\nViết lời giải thích ngắn bằng ngôn ngữ của bạn.\nBước tiếp theo\n[ ] Thêm một ví dụ hoặc hành động cụ thể.\n\nWorkspace guide\nNote Board: select a note, then use Format on the right for text, tags, paper and arrows. Page settings apply only to existing unlocked elements.\nDouble-click a note or image to read or edit its Markdown. Fenced code with a language such as java or json is syntax highlighted.\nConvert to Mind Map: choose a root note; outgoing links become branches, extra/cycle links stay references. Note Board positions remain unchanged.\nMind Map: compact text/image nodes and curved branches. Double-click opens the same Markdown. Use Arrange Mind Map for a layout preview.\nApply saves and shows success feedback. Undo reverses a command. Export JSON to keep your work; examples are fresh copies when reopened.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "size": {
        "width": 260,
        "height": 260
      },
      "style": {
        "backgroundColor": "#FFF2B0",
        "textColor": "#23332D",
        "borderColor": "#8CA694"
      },
